@startuml Flyweight
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
title Flyweight — Business example (C#)

note as N1
Intrinsic state (shared): Instrument fields
(symbol, exchange, currency, isin, sector,
company, tickSize, lotSize, session times).
Extrinsic state (per-occurrence): Quote
bid/ask/last/volume/timestamp.
end note

class Instrument {
  + Symbol : string
  + Exchange : string
  + Currency : string
  + Isin : string
  + Sector : string
  + CompanyName : string
  + TickSize : decimal
  + LotSize : int
  + SessionOpen : TimeOnly
  + SessionClose : TimeOnly
  ~ Instrument(...)
}
note top of Instrument : ConcreteFlyweight\n(intrinsic, immutable, shared)

class InstrumentRegistry {
  - _cache : ConcurrentDictionary<string, Instrument>
  + Get(symbol, exchange, currency, isin, sector, companyName, tickSize, lotSize, sessionOpen, sessionClose) : Instrument
  + Size : int
}
note top of InstrumentRegistry : FlyweightFactory

class Quote <<record>> {
  + Instrument : Instrument
  + Bid : decimal
  + Ask : decimal
  + Last : decimal
  + Volume : long
  + Timestamp : DateTimeOffset
}
note right of Quote : carries extrinsic state\n+ reference to flyweight

class FeedHandler {
  - _quotes : List<Quote>
  - _registry : InstrumentRegistry
  + FeedHandler(registry : InstrumentRegistry)
  + OnTick(instrument : Instrument, bid, ask, last, volume) : void
  + Total : int
  + DistinctInstruments : int
}
note bottom of FeedHandler : Client

InstrumentRegistry o--> "0..*" Instrument : _cache
FeedHandler --> InstrumentRegistry : _registry
FeedHandler o--> "0..*" Quote : _quotes
Quote --> Instrument : shared flyweight

@enduml
